flowchart TB
    Request[Grid query]
    Fanout[Call each service]
    Materialize[Materialize joined rows in app memory]
    Sort[Sort the full joined dataset]
    Page[Return requested page]
    Memory[(Application heap)]
    Failure{Rows keep growing}

    Request --> Fanout --> Materialize --> Sort --> Page
    Materialize --> Memory
    Memory --> Failure
    Failure -->|100K rows| Error[HTTP 500 in benchmark]
    Failure -->|10M-100M rows| Skip[Skipped as impractical]
